{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_48","type":"agent_message","text":"The head-major repack is bit-exact and removes the hidden input copies; local 4,096-token latency is now about 0.20 ms and 7,168 tokens about 0.35 ms. For mixed lengths, I’m testing one final structural improvement: pad each sequence by at most one token, mask that key to `-inf`, run a single batched attention, and unpack. This should halve attention launches on 9 of 16 workloads."}}
